cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SCAN: Synthetic Cognitive Augmentation Network"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: iLevyTate
    website: "https://github.com/iLevyTate"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent system that models prefrontal cortex function to support
  problem-solving, planning and decision-making. Five agents, each standing for
  a different prefrontal region, analyse a topic from a distinct angle, and a
  synthesis step integrates them into a single recommendation.
repository-code: "https://github.com/iLevyTate/SCAN"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.14052884
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - large language models
  - prefrontal cortex
  - decision-making
  - cognitive modelling
